  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/Logos/logo-forge.png\" alt=\"Logo\">\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    |\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge (Forge版)</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载 (Forge版)</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits-for-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge (Fabric版)</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits-for-fabric/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载 (Fabric版)</a>\n    |\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/ChiselsAndBits/Chisels-and-Bits/\" rel=\"nofollow\">源代码</a> \n    |\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/ChiselsAndBits/Chisels-and-Bits/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题反馈</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/ChiselsAndBits/Chisels-and-Bits/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">代码提交</a> \n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chisels_and_bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon赞助</a> \n    |\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.creeperhost.net%252fpartner%252fchisels-and-bits-glv\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreeperHost</a> \n    |\n</div><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chisels_and_bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n  </a><div>\n  感谢游玩本模组！如果您想支持我们持续开发凿与位，请考虑在<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chisels_and_bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>上赞助我们。  \n</div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.creeperhost.net%252fpartner%252fchisels-and-bits-glv\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/CreeperHost.png\" alt=\"CreepherHost\">\n  </a><div>\n  感谢CreeperHost的慷慨支持，现在购买服务器可享25%折扣！点击上方图片，或在结账时使用优惠码\"chisels-and-bits\"！  \n</div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/ForForge.png\" alt=\"For Forge\"><div>\n  如果您想在Fabric端使用凿与位，需要下载专为Fabric及其API设计的特殊版本。\n  该版本模组可在此获取：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits-for-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。\n</div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Wiki.png\" alt=\"维基\">\n  </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.chiselsandbits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a><div>\n  我们所有的物品、方块和系统都有详细文档说明。\n</div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\">\n  </a><div>\n  点击上方图片或<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>加入Discord服务器。   \n</div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Contents.png\" alt=\"模组内容\"><div>\n  <div>想要更圆滑的楼梯？没问题。</div>\n  <div>想要更好看的屋顶或立柱？现在都能实现。</div>\n</div><div>\n  您可以通过混合搭配不同原版方块的\"位元\"来创造全新外观和质感的方块。\n</div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/CompatibilityVanilla.png\" alt=\"与原版兼容\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/CompatibilityMods.png\" alt=\"与其他模组兼容\"><ul>\n  <li>\n    <code>chiselsandbits:chiselable/forced</code>\n    强制使方块可被雕刻（适用于玻璃类方块）\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <code> chiselsandbits:chiselable/blocked</code>\n    阻止原本可雕刻的方块被雕刻\n  </li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
